1
00:01:41,229 --> 00:01:43,940
There, I've packed a delicious lunch.

2
00:01:44,100 --> 00:01:46,640
Mokku, stop sleeping and get up.

3
00:01:46,840 --> 00:01:47,840
Huh?

4
00:01:48,269 --> 00:01:52,680
I'm sure Mokku went to sleep right here last night... Wait, don't tell me... Huh?

5
00:01:53,249 --> 00:01:58,000
Oh dear, oh dear... Good grief, when did you...

6
00:01:59,580 --> 00:01:59,980
Oh dear, oh dear...

7
00:02:00,304 --> 00:02:02,600
Mokku, Mokku, wake up now, come on.

8
00:02:03,360 --> 00:02:04,360
Come on.

9
00:02:06,389 --> 00:02:08,259
Come on, Mokku, that's enough. Wake up.

10
00:02:18,100 --> 00:02:20,240
Grandpa, it feels like I'm diving.

11
00:02:22,269 --> 00:02:24,920
You have to sleep properly in your bed.

12
00:02:25,720 --> 00:02:29,280
If I sleep in a bed, my body will get all soft and squishy!

13
00:02:31,140 --> 00:02:33,560
Everyone sleeps in a bed.

14
00:02:34,510 --> 00:02:36,760
But I'm a hard wooden puppet.

15
00:02:37,600 --> 00:02:42,400
Mokku, I think of you as a real human child.

16
00:02:42,640 --> 00:02:43,960
When will I become human?

17
00:02:44,900 --> 00:02:48,220
Someday, I'm sure you will. Someday, for sure.

18
00:02:53,940 --> 00:02:57,320
Now, be careful. Oh, isn't that Gino?

19
00:03:03,700 --> 00:03:07,440
It's good you have company. Go on, off you go! Gino!

20
00:03:08,740 --> 00:03:16,340
Gino! Wait, I said wait! You... Did you forget your textbooks again? Do you think you're going to school just to play?!

21
00:03:16,620 --> 00:03:24,240
Wait, Mother! I said wait! Hey, stop that! He says he has a headache, you don't have to force him to go!

22
00:03:24,540 --> 00:03:27,160
He's just faking sick because he wants to skip school.

23
00:03:27,810 --> 00:03:30,140
If he hates school, he can help me with my work.

24
00:03:30,385 --> 00:03:31,385
Come on, let's go home.

25
00:03:32,500 --> 00:03:33,500
Hold on.

26
00:03:33,660 --> 00:03:36,880
I will not let this boy become a chimney sweep!

27
00:03:37,124 --> 00:03:39,400
My son is taking over my trade.

28
00:03:39,785 --> 00:03:41,640
I'll never let you!

29
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:42,800
He certainly will.

30
00:03:44,480 --> 00:03:45,200
Let go!

31
00:03:45,300 --> 00:03:47,320
I won't! You let go!

32
00:03:47,440 --> 00:03:49,580
He is going to become a fine official!

33
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:51,540
No more chimney sweeping!

34
00:03:56,080 --> 00:04:01,200
Stop it, both of you. Are you trying to tear the child in two?

35
00:04:01,500 --> 00:04:03,841
Grandpa, but she— Shut up, you!

36
00:04:04,119 --> 00:04:05,119
What did you say?

37
00:04:05,660 --> 00:04:10,120
Now, now. Go on, Gino, head to school with Mokku. Go on, Mokku.

38
00:04:11,680 --> 00:04:13,120
Please look after him, Mokku.

39
00:04:13,614 --> 00:04:15,800
Well, buddy, shall we get going?

40
00:04:27,995 --> 00:04:30,320
Hurry up! We're gonna be late!

41
00:04:43,925 --> 00:04:47,980
H-Hey, Gino! Where are you going? That's the long way!

42
00:04:48,070 --> 00:04:51,520
I know that. If I drag my feet, I'll get there just as it's ending. Perfect.

43
00:04:52,160 --> 00:04:56,560
No! That's no good! You have to go to school and study properly!

44
00:04:57,015 --> 00:05:01,700
A slacker like you will never become a respectable human! Don't you even understand that?

45
00:05:03,280 --> 00:05:04,620
*You're* going to become human?

46
00:05:04,660 --> 00:05:05,660
Is that funny?

47
00:05:07,470 --> 00:05:09,000
Because it's ridiculous!

48
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:10,140
What's so ridiculous about it?!

49
00:05:10,640 --> 00:05:12,580
I'm jealous of you being a puppet!

50
00:05:12,745 --> 00:05:13,745
What?

51
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:19,760
If you're born the son of a chimney sweep, your old man tries to make you take over his filthy trade,

52
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:23,620
and your mom forces you to study so you can make something of yourself and become an official.

53
00:05:25,020 --> 00:05:30,420
Man, I'd rather be a puppet like you, or even that stupid-looking stray cat over there. Life would be so much easier.

54
00:05:31,495 --> 00:05:34,100
You don't even know how pitiful it is being a puppet, so don't talk down to me!

55
00:05:34,660 --> 00:05:35,280
Talk down to you?

56
00:05:35,640 --> 00:05:39,860
That's right! You're already human, the very thing I long to be! You're taking it for granted!

57
00:05:40,275 --> 00:05:42,780
What? You're the one who's getting cocky for a puppet!

58
00:05:43,500 --> 00:05:44,500
Ouch!

59
00:05:45,100 --> 00:05:46,100
Take that!

60
00:05:49,960 --> 00:05:50,960
Ah!

61
00:05:52,920 --> 00:05:55,680
Why don't you have any backbone?

62
00:05:56,040 --> 00:05:57,220
Damn it!

63
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:07,000
Ah!

64
00:06:10,155 --> 00:06:11,420
Hey, stop it!

65
00:06:11,520 --> 00:06:12,520
Whoa!

66
00:06:19,760 --> 00:06:22,760
Day 2

67
00:06:24,540 --> 00:06:27,900
Damn it... That's so cruel...

68
00:06:30,660 --> 00:06:32,300
That's what you get for picking on the weak.

69
00:06:32,635 --> 00:06:34,420
You're the one who hit me!

70
00:06:35,340 --> 00:06:36,340
So what? It was barely anything.

71
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:37,600
Come on, let's go to school.

72
00:06:47,380 --> 00:06:53,340
See? I'm taller, right? Yeah, by at least five centimeters. Franco's really shot up lately.

73
00:06:53,660 --> 00:06:58,520
Well, I eat well, sleep well, and get plenty of exercise... Not that I do any studying, though!

74
00:07:01,215 --> 00:07:02,340
You're late, Mokku.

75
00:07:02,485 --> 00:07:03,740
We thought you were absent today.

76
00:07:04,105 --> 00:07:06,560
Mokku, compare your height with Franco, too.

77
00:07:07,880 --> 00:07:08,900
What the heck?

78
00:07:09,380 --> 00:07:10,840
Mokku, you're such a runt.

79
00:07:11,040 --> 00:07:13,520
Well, a wooden puppet isn't going to grow, anyway.

80
00:07:14,095 --> 00:07:16,280
Guess that means you'll be a runt forever.

81
00:07:17,660 --> 00:07:21,720
Poor little thing... "That's not true! I can become human, too!"

82
00:07:22,230 --> 00:07:25,420
Once I'm human, I'll shoot right up and won't lose to any of you!

83
00:07:25,750 --> 00:07:27,740
Oh yeah? And when's that gonna happen?

84
00:07:29,420 --> 00:07:30,420
Yeah, when?

85
00:07:30,845 --> 00:07:32,820
I'll do it soon, you'll see!

86
00:07:36,065 --> 00:07:37,360
That's a good one!

87
00:07:41,200 --> 00:07:45,400
I heard you want to become an official like my dad. Is that true?

88
00:07:46,100 --> 00:07:48,760
I'd never want to be some pompous official who just bosses people around.

89
00:07:49,090 --> 00:07:53,380
You won't have an easy life unless you're from a good family, smart, and study hard.

90
00:07:53,905 --> 00:07:55,820
Sounds like a chimney sweep.

91
00:07:56,800 --> 00:07:57,980
Who'd want a job like that?

92
00:07:58,270 --> 00:08:01,900
Good point. Getting covered in black soot sounds awful.

93
00:08:02,940 --> 00:08:04,680
That's why nobody wants to do it.

94
00:08:05,510 --> 00:08:07,380
Then what will you be when you grow up?

95
00:08:10,655 --> 00:08:11,655
A bug, maybe?

96
00:08:11,780 --> 00:08:13,040
A crybaby!

97
00:08:16,060 --> 00:08:19,260
Crybaby bug! Crybaby, crybug!

98
00:08:20,500 --> 00:08:23,060
Cry, cry, crybaby!

99
00:08:23,860 --> 00:08:25,860
Cry, cry, crybaby!

100
00:08:28,550 --> 00:08:30,280
Let's eat!

101
00:08:31,820 --> 00:08:34,340
Yay, lunchtime! Let's eat!

102
00:08:37,315 --> 00:08:38,440
That looks good, Mokku.

103
00:08:38,640 --> 00:08:39,940
Oh, I forgot to wash my hands.

104
00:08:40,345 --> 00:08:42,179
Going to get a drink of water, Mr. Puppet?

105
00:08:43,109 --> 00:08:44,880
What I drink is my own business!

106
00:08:45,400 --> 00:08:48,620
Must be convenient only needing water.

107
00:08:49,475 --> 00:08:51,360
Yeah, puppets are cheap to feed!

108
00:08:51,585 --> 00:08:55,780
Water-drinking puppet! Waterbag! Why don't you try becoming human?

109
00:08:57,280 --> 00:09:01,100
Hey, what are you doing?!

110
00:09:05,219 --> 00:09:10,360
You... Stop it!

111
00:09:10,640 --> 00:09:11,840
What do you think you're doing?!

112
00:09:11,890 --> 00:09:12,890
What the...

113
00:09:14,265 --> 00:09:18,361
Damn it... It's dangerous, move aside! What is wrong with you?!

114
00:09:19,979 --> 00:09:21,280
Hey! What is going on here?!

115
00:09:25,709 --> 00:09:27,660
Stand here until I say so.

116
00:09:34,039 --> 00:09:37,160
If Grandpa saw me like this, he'd be so disappointed...

117
00:09:38,349 --> 00:09:39,740
I want to become human soon.

118
00:09:40,115 --> 00:09:43,240
Just like everyone else... growing bigger, eating lunch...

119
00:09:44,100 --> 00:09:46,100
What do I have to do to become human?

120
00:09:46,700 --> 00:09:47,700
Mokku.

121
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:48,360
Who's there?

122
00:09:48,900 --> 00:09:50,300
Up here, in the tree.

123
00:09:51,660 --> 00:09:52,660
(giggles)

124
00:09:53,150 --> 00:09:54,920
Oh, you're from the crossroads earlier!

125
00:09:55,569 --> 00:10:00,520
That's right. I'm pretty well-known among the stray cats. Name's Nora.

126
00:10:00,639 --> 00:10:01,920
I'm busy right now.

127
00:10:02,100 --> 00:10:03,760
Looks to me like you're just standing there.

128
00:10:04,039 --> 00:10:06,020
I *have* to stand here, that's the point!

129
00:10:06,260 --> 00:10:08,480
And that's because you're a wooden puppet, right?

130
00:10:08,709 --> 00:10:11,120
Yeah. Everyone makes fun of me.

131
00:10:11,460 --> 00:10:14,880
Then just become human already. / It's not that easy!

132
00:10:15,120 --> 00:10:16,960
Well, I have some good news for you.

133
00:10:17,840 --> 00:10:18,480
Good news?

134
00:10:18,481 --> 00:10:20,610
A way to become human right away.

135
00:10:23,460 --> 00:10:24,500
Look at that face.

136
00:10:24,945 --> 00:10:27,020
T-Tell me, Miss Stray Cat! Hurry!

137
00:10:27,335 --> 00:10:30,880
Say it softly—it's *No-ra*. Stretch it out, or else.

138
00:10:31,620 --> 00:10:34,180
Please, Miss Nora!

139
00:10:36,080 --> 00:10:37,080
Very well.

140
00:10:40,454 --> 00:10:41,480
Follow me.

141
00:10:42,160 --> 00:10:43,160
Okay!

142
00:10:46,180 --> 00:10:49,400
Stop it, Mokku. You're being punished right now.

143
00:10:49,510 --> 00:10:50,940
I'm just going for a minute.

144
00:10:51,260 --> 00:10:53,800
Things that sound too good to be true never end well.

145
00:10:54,180 --> 00:10:55,720
You don't know that until you go check it out.

146
00:10:56,175 --> 00:10:58,000
That's how you always get into trouble.

147
00:10:58,480 --> 00:11:00,620
If it sounds fishy, I'll just turn it down and come back.

148
00:11:01,279 --> 00:11:03,700
If you were capable of that, I'd be back from the dead by now.

149
00:11:04,120 --> 00:11:05,460
I've had enough of your meddling.

150
00:11:06,609 --> 00:11:07,660
Meddling, you say?

151
00:11:09,020 --> 00:11:11,660
No, I said, "Thanks for looking after me!"

152
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:18,480
It's Gino.

153
00:11:22,049 --> 00:11:24,600
My kitten died because of him.

154
00:11:25,129 --> 00:11:26,129
Then what about that kitten?

155
00:11:26,380 --> 00:11:28,820
Never mind that. Now, just listen to him whine.

156
00:11:29,620 --> 00:11:30,620
Damn it!

157
00:11:31,655 --> 00:11:36,400
Ugh, I hate this. Getting picked on by everyone is all Mom and Dad's fault.

158
00:11:37,025 --> 00:11:38,900
I hate every last one of them.

159
00:11:39,375 --> 00:11:42,060
"Put your feet like this," "don't do that," "you can't do this."

160
00:11:43,065 --> 00:11:44,880
I don't wanna be human anymore!

161
00:11:45,944 --> 00:11:48,360
You heard that, right? He says he wants to quit being human.

162
00:11:48,700 --> 00:11:53,280
You want to be human. It's a perfect match, isn't it? What do you mean by that?

163
00:11:53,480 --> 00:12:00,280
How frustrating. If you just take what's most precious to a human, you'll become one yourself. Their most precious thing?

164
00:12:00,665 --> 00:12:04,960
While he's asleep, sneak in and take his heart. Right now.

165
00:12:05,255 --> 00:12:06,255
I can become human?

166
00:12:08,630 --> 00:12:11,380
Alright, I'll take Gino's heart.

167
00:12:11,535 --> 00:12:16,380
Mokku, it's a trap! A terrible trap! If you do that, Grandfather will be heartbroken!

168
00:12:16,750 --> 00:12:19,100
Grandpa will be happy if I become human!

169
00:12:19,675 --> 00:12:22,800
That stray cat is just using you. Don't be fooled!

170
00:12:23,520 --> 00:12:26,140
Shut up! I just want to become human as soon as I can!

171
00:12:28,149 --> 00:12:30,140
Looks like it's going to work.

172
00:12:48,209 --> 00:12:51,860
Heart... I wonder where he keeps his heart?

173
00:12:53,500 --> 00:12:58,140
Since it's what humans cherish most, it must be safely tucked away somewhere.

174
00:13:06,605 --> 00:13:09,380
Not this one. Not this either.

175
00:13:15,920 --> 00:13:21,600
This is definitely an elephant. An animal called an elephant. A white elephant.

176
00:13:22,760 --> 00:13:24,980
A white elephant... A "white elephant."

177
00:13:25,640 --> 00:13:26,640
This is it!

178
00:13:27,480 --> 00:13:29,240
It wasn't a heart, it was a white elephant!

179
00:13:29,585 --> 00:13:31,260
I must have misheard!

180
00:13:37,020 --> 00:13:40,380
A white elephant? That's hilarious!

181
00:13:41,320 --> 00:13:43,500
Is a white elephant really that funny?

182
00:13:43,560 --> 00:13:44,900
I'm laughing so hard my face hurts!

183
00:13:47,479 --> 00:13:48,479
What's the matter with you?!

184
00:13:50,820 --> 00:13:52,820
What are you laughing at, too?!

185
00:13:55,080 --> 00:14:03,080
Because the heart is the fountain of life. It's like a waterwheel inside your chest, constantly pumping fresh blood throughout your body.

186
00:14:03,560 --> 00:14:05,420
I see. So that's how it works.

187
00:14:07,760 --> 00:14:11,700
A complete and utter mistake. How rich.

188
00:14:11,860 --> 00:14:13,900
Good grief, this is why I hate this.

189
00:14:17,010 --> 00:14:22,780
I get it. All right. This time, a real heart... Ah! Idiot! Stop! Don't!

190
00:14:23,289 --> 00:14:24,420
Do it right!

191
00:14:25,909 --> 00:14:27,360
No! Mokku! Don't!

192
00:14:28,329 --> 00:14:29,920
Gino is a bad guy!

193
00:14:30,200 --> 00:14:33,000
Mokku! Do you really want to become human so badly you'd go that far?

194
00:14:33,770 --> 00:14:35,520
I do! I want to, no matter what!

195
00:14:38,225 --> 00:14:39,720
He's serious.

196
00:14:51,120 --> 00:14:52,120
(cries)

197
00:15:01,769 --> 00:15:04,100
W-What's wrong, Mokku? Wh-What do you want?

198
00:15:04,285 --> 00:15:05,780
I want your heart.

199
00:15:07,109 --> 00:15:08,360
C-Come on, stop joking around.

200
00:15:08,835 --> 00:15:10,760
If you don't want to be human, you don't need a heart.

201
00:15:11,175 --> 00:15:12,540
Wh-What are you talking about?

202
00:15:12,720 --> 00:15:15,660
You'll become a puppet, and I'll become human.

203
00:15:17,640 --> 00:15:18,640
(cries)

204
00:15:21,805 --> 00:15:23,280
Help me!

205
00:15:24,055 --> 00:15:26,220
I'm just taking your heart!

206
00:15:27,360 --> 00:15:33,160
He's going to kill me... Help!

207
00:15:37,074 --> 00:15:38,960
Dad, help me!

208
00:15:45,680 --> 00:15:47,800
Gino, what's wrong? Gino!

209
00:15:47,985 --> 00:15:49,420
You damn puppet!

210
00:15:50,294 --> 00:15:51,294
Gino...

211
00:15:52,140 --> 00:16:00,440
Poor Gino... You made a puppet using my heart, damn you!

212
00:16:00,580 --> 00:16:01,580
N-No, that's not it!

213
00:16:01,710 --> 00:16:03,220
Hurry and destroy that thing!

214
00:16:04,180 --> 00:16:06,200
All right, I'll snap its neck!

215
00:16:07,280 --> 00:16:08,960
I-I can't breathe...

216
00:16:09,465 --> 00:16:16,180
If my neck breaks, it's all over... I've got to get away!

217
00:16:16,615 --> 00:16:19,820
I can't breathe... No...

218
00:16:25,520 --> 00:16:27,240
Time to get out of here! Hurry!

219
00:16:28,200 --> 00:16:29,200
Hurry!

220
00:16:33,799 --> 00:16:34,799
He got away!

221
00:16:37,100 --> 00:16:39,460
Quick! The man-eating puppet is escaping!

222
00:16:39,660 --> 00:16:40,680
Hold it, you damn puppet!

223
00:16:42,520 --> 00:16:43,760
Let go! Let me go!

224
00:16:43,940 --> 00:16:44,940
You're not getting away!

225
00:16:46,089 --> 00:16:47,680
I'll throw you right in!

226
00:16:58,384 --> 00:17:00,420
Fall into the fireplace and burn to ashes!

227
00:17:01,699 --> 00:17:03,260
My butt's catching fire!

228
00:17:03,261 --> 00:17:05,260
Ah, the puppet is...

229
00:17:09,609 --> 00:17:11,300
You'll be burned to a crisp in no time!

230
00:17:21,530 --> 00:17:25,880
Still hanging on, are you? All right, I'll chop those hands off and drop you in!

231
00:17:28,780 --> 00:17:30,560
Help me, Grandpa!

232
00:17:33,260 --> 00:17:34,260
Stop it!

233
00:17:34,920 --> 00:17:35,920
Huh?

234
00:17:36,589 --> 00:17:39,760
Stop, please forgive Mokku... Why, Gino?

235
00:17:40,639 --> 00:17:46,160
B-Because I said I hated humans, Mokku went and... Why on earth would you say that?!

236
00:17:46,679 --> 00:17:51,720
But, but... Alright, I won't get mad, so tell me what happened.

237
00:17:52,334 --> 00:17:59,360
Because I'm stupid, so I can't become a great official, and I'm weak, so I can't be a chimney sweep either.

238
00:17:59,939 --> 00:18:04,360
That's why everyone makes fun of me and nobody will play with me.

239
00:18:05,460 --> 00:18:11,600
Good grief... What a disgrace. Are you really such a coward?

240
00:18:12,104 --> 00:18:15,020
Are you already deciding you can't do anything?

241
00:18:15,764 --> 00:18:19,680
I only asked you to help with my work to toughen you up.

242
00:18:20,864 --> 00:18:24,540
If you really hated chimney sweeping that much, you should've just said so.

243
00:18:25,584 --> 00:18:28,020
I'm sorry for pushing studying on you so much, too.

244
00:18:32,059 --> 00:18:39,960
I just thought studying would help you become a respectable man, but it only ended up making you suffer.

245
00:18:40,564 --> 00:18:43,380
Enough! Leave him alone! The coward!

246
00:18:49,740 --> 00:18:53,380
Mokku, I'm sorry for being rough with you. I had no idea it was like this.

247
00:18:56,639 --> 00:18:59,000
If you want that boy's heart, take it.

248
00:18:59,960 --> 00:19:00,960
What?

249
00:19:01,564 --> 00:19:05,540
I don't need a spineless son like this. Go on, gouge his heart out with this!

250
00:19:08,334 --> 00:19:10,060
(Mother crying)

251
00:19:14,419 --> 00:19:16,860
(Mother crying)

252
00:19:21,739 --> 00:19:26,920
Mokku, please forgive me. I was wrong. I'll do my best at everything from now on, so please forgive me.

253
00:19:27,519 --> 00:19:32,540
No, no. You'll just lose heart again and start whining. Come on, Mokku.

254
00:19:34,799 --> 00:19:40,400
Gino, you were lying about giving up on being human. I truly want to become a human.

255
00:19:41,280 --> 00:19:45,080
I'm sorry. I really do want to stay human. Please forgive me.

256
00:19:45,200 --> 00:19:46,200
Please forgive him.

257
00:20:10,024 --> 00:20:11,940
Please rest a little longer.

258
00:20:15,199 --> 00:20:16,280
I'm so glad.

259
00:20:17,449 --> 00:20:19,840
Gino, you must grow into a strong human.

260
00:20:20,194 --> 00:20:23,540
Even if you lack strength, as long as you never give up and keep trying,

261
00:20:24,124 --> 00:20:26,320
you will grow to be better tomorrow than you are today.

262
00:20:27,039 --> 00:20:29,260
That is what sets humans apart from all other creatures.

263
00:20:29,919 --> 00:20:31,900
Look at that beautiful sunrise.

264
00:20:32,739 --> 00:20:37,040
This village used to be thick with trees and home to wild beasts, just like the forest over there.

265
00:20:37,724 --> 00:20:42,260
It was us humans who cleared the brush, built homes, and made this town.

266
00:20:43,034 --> 00:20:45,280
Being human is something to be proud of.

267
00:20:47,489 --> 00:20:49,600
Why didn't I realize that until now?

268
00:20:50,404 --> 00:20:52,560
It's not too late, Gino.

269
00:20:53,749 --> 00:20:56,360
Look, smoke is rising from all the chimneys.

270
00:20:57,654 --> 00:20:59,880
Mokku, good job finding it.

271
00:21:00,569 --> 00:21:06,840
I cleaned every single one of those chimneys. That smoke cooks delicious breakfasts and keeps homes warm.

272
00:21:07,219 --> 00:21:08,880
What if you didn't clean them, Dad?

273
00:21:09,429 --> 00:21:16,160
Smoke and flames would get trapped and start a fire. That's why I put my heart into this dirty work.

274
00:21:16,839 --> 00:21:20,560
All right! I'm going to do something useful for the world, too!

275
00:21:20,895 --> 00:21:21,895
That's the spirit!

276
00:21:26,589 --> 00:21:28,420
Humans are so wonderful.

277
00:21:32,679 --> 00:21:36,740
And yet... look at me. Wooden hands... wooden feet... Damn it!

278
00:21:38,320 --> 00:21:39,320
Mokku!

279
00:21:41,989 --> 00:21:43,620
Why are you so frustrated?

280
00:21:43,964 --> 00:21:46,280
Huh? Becoming human was a lie, wasn't it?!

281
00:21:46,984 --> 00:21:48,920
You're just bitter because you lost to Gino, aren't you?

282
00:21:48,980 --> 00:21:52,220
Lost? I spared him! I was the winner!

283
00:21:52,999 --> 00:21:59,860
Gino reformed and resolved to become a decent person... while you tried to take someone's life just to become human...

284
00:22:00,229 --> 00:22:03,280
You still haven't learned your lesson. I'll just take someone else's heart!

285
00:22:03,400 --> 00:22:07,660
Mokku, taking another person's life is completely unforgivable.

286
00:22:08,439 --> 00:22:11,980
If you can't understand that, I will turn you back into an oak tree.

287
00:22:12,809 --> 00:22:15,820
A-All right! I understand, so please don't do that!

288
00:22:17,549 --> 00:22:22,720
If you have a pure heart and stay a good boy, you will surely become human. It's the truth.

289
00:22:24,220 --> 00:22:29,600
I look forward to seeing who becomes a fine human first—Gino or Mokku.

290
00:22:39,054 --> 00:22:44,300
Thanks to you, I almost got burned in a chimney and turned back into an oak tree!

291
00:22:45,319 --> 00:22:50,280
And after all that, I was going to make that bastard pay for killing my sweet child...

292
00:22:51,759 --> 00:22:54,260
Forget that. How about this? I've got a great proposition for you.

293
00:22:55,369 --> 00:22:57,140
Nothing good ever comes from your "great propositions."

294
00:22:58,259 --> 00:22:59,860
You've gotten a little smarter, haven't you?

295
00:23:00,789 --> 00:23:03,120
Grandpa will be worried, so I have to get back soon.

296
00:23:03,474 --> 00:23:05,680
Oh right, isn't the circus coming to town?

297
00:23:06,399 --> 00:23:07,399
The circus?

298
00:23:07,919 --> 00:23:10,120
I've got all kinds of news, you know.

299
00:23:15,849 --> 00:23:16,960
A circus, huh?

300
00:23:18,919 --> 00:23:21,120
Tell me! Come on, tell me!

301
00:23:21,569 --> 00:23:23,760
Nora! Miss Nora!

302
00:23:27,400 --> 00:23:28,400
Good grief.

303
00:23:36,000 --> 00:23:44,000
A terrifying witch who kidnaps children to suck their blood. Deep in the forest where this witch lurks, Mokku sets off on an expedition to test his courage.

304
00:23:50,169 --> 00:23:57,420
Wolves and bats attack Mokku and his friends as they wander into the eerie darkness. Disguised as Madame Egret, the vampire witch bares her sharp fangs, hungering for Mokku's life.

305
00:23:58,119 --> 00:24:01,240
Look forward to next week's Kashi no Ki Mokku!

